  "slug": "high-protein-bread",
  "name": "High-Protein Bread",
  "recipe_type": null,
  "brief_description": "This high-protein bread is simple to make in your bread machine with oat bran and three types of flour: bread flour, whole wheat flour, and soy flour.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Place water, honey, canola oil, bread flour, whole wheat flour, soy flour, powdered soy milk, oat bran, salt, and yeast into a bread machine in the order listed, or follow the order recommended by the manufacturer if different. Run Basic Medium or Regular cycle. Remove loaf from the machine after the cycle is done, about 2 hours 55 minutes."
    }
  ],
